§§ `Article 31 — The structure of the invested assets`

-- The asset classes named are realised as `An investment asset` in the nouns module. The
-- Company "sẽ lựa chọn" (will choose) among assets such as these; the list governs nothing a
-- policyholder can test, so it is inert apart from that enumeration.
-- src:2348 | Điều 31: Cơ cấu tài sản đầu tư
